279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 107 0 R
/T (A retail bank modernizing its operations chose a hybrid strategy: the core banking engine and the customer-facing mobile banking app, which required deep customization, high performance, and strict security, were built using traditional coding, while internal tools such as loan application intake, document verification requests, and branch service forms were built using a low-code platform. This allowed the core engineering team to focus their traditional coding effort on the systems that provided the greatest competitive differentiation, while business teams were empowered to build and maintain their own lightweight internal tools.)
/E (A retail bank modernizing its operations chose a hybrid strategy: the core banking engine and the customer-facing mobile banking app, which required deep customization, high performance, and strict security, were built using traditional coding, while internal tools such as loan application intake, document verification requests, and branch service forms were built using a low-code platform. This allowed the core engineering team to focus their traditional coding effort on the systems that provided the greatest competitive differentiation, while business teams were empowered to build and maintain their own lightweight internal tools.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
