/P 108 0 R
/T (Organizations adopting low-code platforms at scale must establish governance frameworks to manage application sprawl, ensure consistent data handling practices, and track which business units own which applications. Without such governance, low-code adoption can lead to a proliferation of loosely managed applications that are difficult to audit or maintain over time.)
/E (Organizations adopting low-code platforms at scale must establish governance frameworks to manage application sprawl, ensure consistent data handling practices, and track which business units own which applications. Without such governance, low-code adoption can lead to a proliferation of loosely managed applications that are difficult to audit or maintain over time.)
